# ...except the SongnestPy sources: the Chaquopy setup (Gradle plugin +
# pinned yt-dlp), the songnestpy bridge module, and MainActivity init are
# hand-maintained inputs to the Android build, not regenerable outputs.
# (Keep the `/*` contents-ignore form: excluding a directory itself would
# make every negation below it a no-op.)
!src-tauri/gen/android/
src-tauri/gen/android/*
!src-tauri/gen/android/app/
!src-tauri/gen/android/gradle.properties
src-tauri/gen/android/app/*
!src-tauri/gen/android/app/build.gradle.kts
!src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/
src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/*
!src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/main/
